  - fieldLabel: Blowjob
    localizedDataList:
    - languageCode: en
      key: Blowjob
  costExp: 30
  iconStory: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 737d5bb600763df439ec9c2f2d6d1f80, type: 3}
  localizator:
    translationJson: {fileID: 4900000, guid: e27ef46982ce67a469b822aae92cd114, type: 3}
    _translator:
      languages:
      - languageCode: en
        messages:
        - key: Hey, Jessy! You're early today.
        - key: "Hi! Yeah, I thought I'd come in early before \nanyone else showed
            up. There's gonna \nbe too many people later."
        - key: "I agree. There's usually \nno one here at this time."
        - key: How are you doing?
        - key: "I'm good, but I don't have a lot of free \ntime at the gym. I'd like
            to work out more \noften, but how can I make myself do it?"
        - key: The last workout was impressive!
        - key: "If every workout ended like that, \nI'd work out more regularly."
        - key: "Do you want me to help you with motivation? \nI know a great method."
        - key: Yeah, sure.
        - key: "Shh... Just be quiet and \nmake sure no one comes."
      - languageCode: ru
        messages:
        - key: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442, \u0414\u0436\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438!
            \u0422\u044B \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043E\u0434\u043D\u044F \u0440\u0430\u043D\u043E."
        - key: "\u041F\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442! \u0414\u0430, \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043B\u0430
            \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0430\u043D\u044C\u0448\u0435,
            \n\u043F\u043E\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E \u043D\u0435\u0442.
            \u0410 \u0442\u043E \u043F\u043E\u0442\u043E\u043C \n\u043D\u0430\u0431\u0435\u0433\u0443\u0442
            \u0438 \u043D\u0435 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0442\u043E\u043B\u043A\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F."
        - key: "\u0421\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0430\u0441\u0435\u043D. \u0412 \u044D\u0442\u043E
            \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F \n\u0437\u0434\u0435\u0441\u044C \u043E\u0431\u044B\u0447\u043D\u043E
            \u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E \u043D\u0435\u0442."
        - key: "\u041A\u0430\u043A \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430?"
        - key: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E, \u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E
            \u043C\u0430\u043B\u043E \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
            \n\u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043B.
            \u0425\u043E\u0442\u0435\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C \u0431\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
            \n\u0447\u0430\u0449\u0435, \u043D\u043E \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044F
            \u0437\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C?"
        - key: "\u041F\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043B\u0430\u044F \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043A\u0430
            \n\u0431\u044B\u043B\u0430 \u0432\u043F\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0442\u043B\u044F\u044E\u0449\u0435\u0439!"
        - key: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0431\u044B \u043A\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u044F
            \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043A\u0430 \n\u0437\u0430\u043A\u0430\u043D\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0430\u0441\u044C
            \u0442\u0430\u043A, \u044F \n\u0431\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u043B\u0441\u044F
            \u0440\u0435\u0433\u0443\u043B\u044F\u0440\u043D\u0435\u0435."
        - key: "\u0425\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C \u044F \u043F\u043E\u043C\u043E\u0433\u0443
            \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0441 \u043C\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0435\u0439?
            \n\u042F \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E \u043E\u0442\u043B\u0438\u0447\u043D\u044B\u0439
            \u043C\u0435\u0442\u043E\u0434."
        - key: "\u041D\u0443 \u0434\u0430\u2026 \u043A\u043E\u043D\u0435\u0447\u043D\u043E\u2026"
        - key: "\u0422\u0441\u0441\u0441\u2026 \u0422\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E
            \u0442\u0438\u0445\u043E \u0438 \u0441\u043C\u043E\u0442\u0440\u0438,
            \n\u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043D\u0438\u043A\u0442\u043E \u043D\u0435
            \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0448\u0435\u043B."
      - languageCode: de
        messages:
        - key: "Hey, Jessy! Du bist heute fr\xFCh dran."
        - key: "Hi! Ja, ich dachte, ich komme fr\xFCher,\n wenn noch niemand da ist.
            Sp\xE4ter \nwerden es zu viele Leute sein."
        - key: "Finde ich auch. Normalerweise \nist um diese Zeit niemand hier."
        - key: Wie geht's dir denn so?
        - key: "Mir geht es gut, aber ich habe nicht \nviel Zeit im Fitnessstudio.
            Ich w\xFCrde \ngern \xF6fter trainieren, aber wie \nkann ich mich dazu
            zwingen?"
        - key: "Das Training von gestern \nAbend war beeindruckend!"
        - key: "Wenn jede Trainingseinheit so enden \nw\xFCrde, w\xFCrde ich regelm\xE4\xDFiger
            trainieren."
        - key: "Soll ich dir helfen, dich zu motivieren? \nIch kenne eine tolle Methode."
        - key: Ja, klar.
        - key: Sei einfach leise und lass niemanden rein.
      - languageCode: fr
        messages:
        - key: "H\xE9, Jessy ! Tu es en avance aujourd'hui."
        - key: "Bonjour ! Oui, j'ai pens\xE9 venir \nplus t\xF4t pendant qu'il n'y
            a personne. \nIl y aura trop de monde plus tard."
        - key: "Je suis d'accord. D'habitude, \nil n'y a personne ici \xE0 cette
            heure-ci."
        - key: Comment allez-vous ?
        - key: "Bien, mais je n'ai pas beaucoup de \ntemps libre \xE0 la salle de
            sport. \nJ'aimerais faire de l'exercice \nplus souvent, mais comment
            m'y prendre ?"
        - key: "La s\xE9ance d'entra\xEEnement d'hier \nsoir \xE9tait impressionnante
            !"
        - key: "Si toutes les s\xE9ances d'entra\xEEnement \nse terminaient ainsi,
            je m'entra\xEEnerais \nplus r\xE9guli\xE8rement."
        - key: "Tu veux que je t'aide \xE0 te motiver ? \nJe connais une bonne m\xE9thode."
        - key: "Oui, bien s\xFBr."
        - key: "Chut... Ne fais pas de bruit \net ne laisse personne entrer."
      - languageCode: it
        messages:
        - key: Ehi, Jessy! Sei in anticipo oggi.
        - key: "Ciao! S\xEC, ho pensato di venire prima \nquando non c'\xE8 nessuno.
            Pi\xF9 \ntardi ci sar\xE0 troppa gente."
        - key: "Sono d'accordo. Di solito \nnon c'\xE8 nessuno a quest'ora."
        - key: Come sta?
        - key: "Sto bene, ma non ho molto tempo \nlibero in palestra. Vorrei allenarmi
            \npi\xF9 spesso, ma come posso \ncostringermi a farlo?"
        - key: "L'allenamento di ieri sera \n\xE8 stato impressionante!"
        - key: "Se ogni allenamento finisse cos\xEC, \nmi allenerei pi\xF9 regolarmente."
        - key: "Vuoi che ti aiuti a motivarti? \nConosco un ottimo metodo."
        - key: "S\xEC, certo."
        - key: Fai silenzio e non far entrare nessuno.
      - languageCode: sp
        messages:
        - key: "\xA1Hola, Jessy! Llegas temprano hoy."
        - key: "\xA1Hola! S\xED, pens\xE9 en venir \ntemprano mientras no hay nadie.
            \nHabr\xE1 demasiada gente m\xE1s tarde."
        - key: "Estoy de acuerdo. Normalmente \nno hay nadie aqu\xED a esta hora."
        - key: "\xBFQu\xE9 tal est\xE1s?"
        - key: "Bien, pero no tengo mucho tiempo libre \nen el gimnasio. Me gustar\xEDa
            hacer \nejercicio m\xE1s a menudo, pero \n\xBFc\xF3mo puedo obligarme
            a hacerlo?"
        - key: "El entrenamiento de \nanoche fue impresionante."
        - key: "Si todos los entrenamientos acabaran as\xED, lo har\xEDa m\xE1s a
            menudo."
        - key: "\xBFQuieres que te ayude a motivarte? \nConozco un m\xE9todo genial."
        - key: "S\xED, claro."
        - key: "Shh... S\xF3lo qu\xE9date callado \ny no dejes que nadie entre."
