      key: Come sta?
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: sp
      key: "\xBFQu\xE9 tal est\xE1s?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
  - ActorIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fb1c9b1c77bb5074a897a113a148c4c7, type: 3}
    Msg: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E, \u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E
      \u043C\u0430\u043B\u043E \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
      \n\u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043B.
      \u0425\u043E\u0442\u0435\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C \u0431\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
      \n\u0447\u0430\u0449\u0435, \u043D\u043E \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044F
      \u0437\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C?"
    optionalData:
      GallerySlot: {fileID: 0}
      Branches: []
      otherActorIcon:
        sender: 0
        icon: {fileID: 0}
    AudioMsg: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 739748430cf348048989027196ba8df3, type: 3}
    <Sender>k__BackingField: 1
    localizedAudioClips:
    - languageCode: en
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c00c421163168444be23c1825332659, type: 3}
    - languageCode: ru
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 739748430cf348048989027196ba8df3, type: 3}
    - languageCode: de
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd4f4fefc6c2fc14ab9c52f4b28bf653, type: 3}
    - languageCode: sp
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0095e3a08e08b054c8472b69f36f9705, type: 3}
    - languageCode: it
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5cfe682ae862c5843a4cdd2d89fdee43, type: 3}
    - languageCode: fr
      key: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c64adf8214668d54987a14e1d382d35c, type: 3}
    _localizedData:
    - languageCode: en
      key: "I'm good, but I don't have a lot of free \ntime at the gym. I'd like
        to work out more \noften, but how can I make myself do it?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: ru
      key: "\u0425\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E, \u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E
        \u043C\u0430\u043B\u043E \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \n\u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043B.
        \u0425\u043E\u0442\u0435\u043B\u043E\u0441\u044C \u0431\u044B \u0437\u0430\u043D\u0438\u043C\u0430\u0442\u044C\u0441\u044F
        \n\u0447\u0430\u0449\u0435, \u043D\u043E \u043A\u0430\u043A \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044F
        \u0437\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044C?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: de
      key: "Mir geht es gut, aber ich habe nicht \nviel Zeit im Fitnessstudio. Ich
        w\xFCrde \ngern \xF6fter trainieren, aber wie \nkann ich mich dazu zwingen?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: fr
      key: "Bien, mais je n'ai pas beaucoup de \ntemps libre \xE0 la salle de sport.
        \nJ'aimerais faire de l'exercice \nplus souvent, mais comment m'y prendre
        ?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: it
      key: "Sto bene, ma non ho molto tempo \nlibero in palestra. Vorrei allenarmi
        \npi\xF9 spesso, ma come posso \ncostringermi a farlo?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
    - languageCode: sp
      key: "Bien, pero no tengo mucho tiempo libre \nen el gimnasio. Me gustar\xEDa
        hacer \nejercicio m\xE1s a menudo, pero \n\xBFc\xF3mo puedo obligarme a hacerlo?"
      options:
        font: {fileID: 0}
  - ActorIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d5aff797b862976479822e00dc12b5d4, type: 3}
    Msg: "\u041F\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043B\u0430\u044F \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043A\u0430
